  m_text: 'Connect systems and Deliver files to computers!

    Carry CD from the
    server rooms to someone''s computer. In the world we rely on connections that
    could go out. The way around this is to go a different route. Also in the real
    world data is transmitted in parts of a hole.



    Connect the two laptops
    with the routers by clicking on them. In real life one computer is not wired
    to another directly, normally computers go though a series of small just to talk
    to each other.'
